# Guess Game

A multiplayer browser game where players secretly choose an answer and take turns asking questions to guess each other's answers.

## Tech Stack

Frontend:
- React
- Vite
- Socket.IO Client

Backend:
- Node.js
- Express
- Socket.IO

## Running Locally

### Server

cd server
npm install
npm run dev

### Client

cd client
npm install
npm run dev

Frontend:
http://localhost:5173

Backend:
http://localhost:3001

## Current Features

- Create rooms
- Join rooms
- Secret answers
- Ready system
- Turn-based questions
- Yes/No/Maybe answers
- Guessing players
- Question history

## Known Issues

- Elimination system needs improvement
- Winner handling needs finishing
- UI needs polishing

